      "updated": 1783524407952,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FAITHFUL (what the model gets right):\n• DRAM hierarchy: channel/rank/BG/bank/row/col\n• command timing: ACT / READ / PRE\n   (tRCD, tCCD, tRP)\n• in-bank MAC + accumulation\n\nNOT modeled:\n• data values — no real multiply\n• 'weights' vs 'KV' vs 'activation'\n   — completely invisible to PIMony\n• physical placement changes ONLY\n   bank timing / contention — never\n   correctness or isolation\n\nnum_macs = the count the programmer sets:\nhow many column-steps to sweep (rs2),\none per tCCD_L. Model trusted as-is.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FAITHFUL (what the model gets right):\n• DRAM hierarchy: channel/rank/BG/bank/row/col\n• command timing: ACT / READ / PRE\n   (tRCD, tCCD, tRP)\n• in-bank MAC + accumulation\n\nNOT modeled:\n• data values — no real multiply\n• 'weights' vs 'KV' vs 'activation'\n   — completely invisible to PIMony\n• physical placement changes ONLY\n   bank timing / contention — never\n   correctness or isolation\n\nnum_macs = the count the programmer sets:\nhow many column-steps to sweep (rs2),\none per tCCD_L. Model trusted as-is.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 294,
      "index": "b0F",
